The validation skill requires reproducible independent evidence, so I’m adding three audit artifacts: a concrete LLVM smoke program, an exhaustive CPython differential test using `sum`/`math.prod` as the independent oracle, and two negative K specs. One makes the postcondition false on `[2,3]`; the other mutates `product = 1` to `product = 2` while preserving the expected result, testing body sensitivity.
